      "raw": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b style=\"font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px;\">Rook City</b></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Rook City, a dark place with trouble around every corner. Villains roam the street every now and again, so this city is need of Heros!</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;Here&#39;s some pointers on surviving this dangerous place.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li>Types of Cards: Mainly standard environment cards with a couple special targets; Private eye, Forensic Scientist</li><li>Number of target cards: 3</li><li>Forsensic Scientist and Private eye are cards that actually help your heros out. They look at the environment and villain decks, so if y