      "cooked": "<p>The header of this guide still reads “Realm of Discord.”</p>\n<p>Thematically, Rook City matches the Chairman very well.</p>\n<p>Also, mechanically, villains that play extra environment cards (Chairman, Akash, etc.) make it even more of a nightmare.</p>",
