      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/53a042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-17T23:35:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would argue that Akash works poorly with Rook City, she wants an environment with lots of targets like Final Wasteland, Block, or Enclave. Rook only has 3 targets, which means fewer free plays for her and fewer suprise Entombs. Her few copies of Disrupt the Field doesn't really offset that.</p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>",
